            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$x\\approx1.69$",
              "worked": "$x$ is opposite $25^{\\circ}$ and the hypotenuse is $4$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin\\theta&=\\frac{O}{H}\\\\\\sin25^{\\circ}&=\\frac{x}{4}\\\\4\\sin25^{\\circ}&=x\\\\x&\\approx1.69\\end{align*}$$",
